{"id":"c122cb00ad69a4f6","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-dependent-function-per.md","title":"依赖函数PER的良定义性","display":"thm-dependent-function-per — 依赖函数PER的良定义性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-dependent-function-per","aliases":["72-thm-dependent-function-per"],"display":"thm-dependent-function-per — 依赖函数PER的良定义性","depends_on":["[[72-df-dependent-function-per]]","[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.9, print746–747/PDF758–759; local symmetry and transitivity proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-dependent-function-per"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-dependent-function-per</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dependent-function-per — 依赖函数PER的良定义性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b6318833c3cb4f67\" href=\"?note=b6318833c3cb4f67\" title=\"72-df-dependent-function-per\">72-df-dependent-function-per</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9c13fa158735675\" href=\"?note=b9c13fa158735675\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift\">72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.9, print746–747/PDF758–759; local symmetry and transitivity proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app},\\alpha,\\Phi,Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\">\\(\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app},\\alpha,\\Phi,Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b6318833c3cb4f67\" href=\"?note=b6318833c3cb4f67\" title=\"72-df-dependent-function-per\">72-df-dependent-function-per</a> 的全部条件，特别是纤维在α类上相等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\qquad\n\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\qquad\n\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"vQ^\\Pi w\">\\(vQ^\\Pi w\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\alpha a&#39;\">\\(a\\alpha a&#39;\\)</span>，交换a、a'先得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(v,a&#39;)\\Phi(a&#39;)\\operatorname{app}(w,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(v,a&#39;)\\Phi(a&#39;)\\operatorname{app}(w,a)\\)</span>；用纤维相等与纤维对称性得到反向所需式。传递时，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\alpha a&#39;\">\\(a\\alpha a&#39;\\)</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\alpha a\">\\(a\\alpha a\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(v,a)\\Phi(a)\\operatorname{app}(w,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(v,a)\\Phi(a)\\operatorname{app}(w,a)\\)</span>，再由第二个函数关系得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(w,a)\\Phi(a)\\operatorname{app}(z,a&#39;)\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(w,a)\\Phi(a)\\operatorname{app}(z,a&#39;)\\)</span>，用同一纤维传递性。输入类型为空时关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lam}^2\">\\(\\mathsf{Lam}^2\\)</span>，仍是PER。最后用预求值扩张定理，得到值相容性。该证明检查全部相等输入，而不是仅检查相同代表元上的函数值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-dependent-function-per","status":"resolved","id":"b6318833c3cb4f67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dependent-function-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift","status":"resolved","id":"b9c13fa158735675","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dependent-function-per","status":"resolved","id":"b6318833c3cb4f67","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app},\\alpha,\\Phi,Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}$ 满足 [[72-df-dependent-function-per]] 的全部条件，特别是纤维在α类上相等。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app},\\alpha,\\Phi,Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}","display":false},{"tex":"Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\qquad\n\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).","display":true},{"tex":"vQ^\\Pi w","display":false},{"tex":"a\\alpha a'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(v,a')\\Phi(a')\\operatorname{app}(w,a)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\alpha a'","display":false},{"tex":"a\\alpha a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(v,a)\\Phi(a)\\operatorname{app}(w,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(w,a)\\Phi(a)\\operatorname{app}(z,a')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lam}^2","display":false}],"bytes":1780,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-479","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-dependent-function-per|thm-dependent-function-per — 依赖函数PER的良定义性]]"},{"id":"c5b3799b1501dcab","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P:=\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)$ 及其结构与不变纤维取 [[72-df-dependent-function-per]]，其 PER 性取 [[72-thm-dependent-function-per]]。"}],"outgoing":["b6318833c3cb4f67","b9c13fa158735675"]}